**Affects:** Applications using dev-mode HMR (component template/metadata replacement) with `NgZone`-based change detection; only the internal HMR behaviour changes — no public API changed.

**Action:** none — no application code, configuration or dependency changes are needed; after upgrading, re-verify that hot-reloading a template file keeps bindings and change detection working.

