**Action:** required: run `ng update` so the automatic `InjectFlags` and `TestBed.get` migrations run; then re-verify that any remaining `TestBed.get`/`TestBed.inject` calls use `TestBed.inject(token, { optional: true, ... })`-style object options instead of `InjectFlags`, and that the test suite compiles against `@angular/core` 20.

